Copied files (stored in this repository)
----------------------------------------

web/vendor/design-system/ is a copy of the owner's shared design system, from
its repository https://github.com/jon-lange/design-system: version 0.8.2,
source commit cc180905ceb2743d510baef285682a8ba410b4cb (cc18090), the `dist/` directory of that repository,
unmodified, written by its own `scripts/sync.mjs`. `hashes.json` in the copy
holds the SHA-256 of every file. (Versions up to 0.5 were called Groundwork and
were copied to web/vendor/groundwork/.)

