Bundled at build time (not stored in this repository)
-----------------------------------------------------

The built client (web/dist, produced by `npm run build --prefix web`) contains:

- From the copy of the design system listed above: its stylesheet, the
  Botbench theme's stylesheet (themes/botbench.css), the IBM Plex Sans and IBM
  Plex Mono font files (declared by the design system's stylesheet; the
  Botbench theme sets the platform's own typeface, so a browser does not load
  them), the Lucide icon sprite and the Lucide icons its
  stylesheet draws. Their notices are above. The gallery pages, the checker,
  the rules and the hook in the copy are not part of the built client.
- React and React DOM. Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. MIT License.
